WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.710 --> 00:00:04.040
Ever wanted to learn a language
but couldn't find time?

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:07.010
We present Wait-Learning,
leveraging wait time

00:00:07.010 --> 00:00:09.274
for education.

00:00:09.274 --> 00:00:10.690
Waitchatter detects
when you might

00:00:10.690 --> 00:00:13.210
be waiting for an instant
messaging response

00:00:13.210 --> 00:00:16.900
and presents vocabulary
exercises during that time.

00:00:16.900 --> 00:00:18.700
We found that the
best time to present

00:00:18.700 --> 00:00:22.030
an exercise is immediately
after the user has sent a chat

00:00:22.030 --> 00:00:23.830
message.

00:00:23.830 --> 00:00:26.170
During casual instant
messaging, users

00:00:26.170 --> 00:00:31.860
learn 57 words in 2 weeks, an
average of 4 new words per day.

